ceeded without you","chinese":"要是没有你，我们绝不会成功"},{"english":"in order that training should be effective","chinese":"为了让训练有效"}]},{"id":"should:o:558e84bfa92e","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"假如","glossesEn":["indicating possibility"],"registers":["formal"],"examples":[{"english":"if you should (ever) change your mind, do let me know","chinese":"你（一旦）改变主意的话，一定要告诉我"},{"english":"should anyone call, please tell them I’m busy","chinese":"如果有人打电话来，请告诉他我正忙着"},{"english":"supposing he should die?","chinese":"万一他死了呢？"}]},{"id":"should:o:2e0e9aea9a0c","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"用于引语中表示将来动作","glossesEn":["expressing future in reported speech"],"examples":[{"english":"I said that I should be pleased to help","chinese":"我说过我乐意帮忙"}]},{"id":"should:o:e39b0168e5c3","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"竟然","glossesEn":["in expressions of feelings"],"examples":[{"english":"it's sad that he should object","chinese":"令人遗憾的是，他竟然会反对"},{"english":"I find it astonishing that he should be so rude to you","chinese":"我很吃惊，他居然对你这样无礼"}]},{"id":"should:o:7d4a4c058919","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"用于表示礼貌请求，仅与I或we连用","glossesEn":["in polite requests"],"registers":["formal","British"],"examples":[{"english":"I should like to call my lawyer","chinese":"我希望给我的律师打个电话"},{"english":"I should like a drink","chinese":"我想喝一杯"},{"english":"I should like to ask whether …","chinese":"我想问一问是否…"}]},{"id":"should:o:d1528bf509c1","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"表示不确定，仅与I或we连用","glossesEn":["expressing uncertain opinion"],"examples":[{"english":"I should imagine it will take about three hours","chinese":"我想得用差不多3个小时吧"},{"english":"I should think so","chinese":"我想是吧"},{"english":"will it matter? — I shouldn’t think so","chinese":"这有关系吗？──不会吧"}]},{"id":"should:o:da11c526da65","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"用于表示强烈赞同","glossesEn":["expressing strong agreement"],"examples":[{"english":"nobody will oppose it — I should think not!","chinese":"谁也不会反对──的确不会！"},{"english":"I'll pay you for it — I should hope so!","c